<title>NETHERLANDS: Gucci 1996/97 net up 103 percent.</title>
<headline>Gucci 1996/97 net up 103 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of US dollars unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (dollars)		2.76 vs   1.68</p>
<p>    Net income			   168.4  vs  82.9</p>
<p>    Net revenues			 880.7  vs 500.1</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   239.1  vs 121.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of luxury goods maker is Gucci Group NV</p>
